{"seq":3,"slug":"semantic-matching","title":"语义匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/query-understanding/semantic-matching","wordCount":922,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"语义匹配\">语义匹配</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>语义匹配（Semantic Matching）是判断两段文本是否表达相同或相关含义的任务，是搜索系统中查询-文档相关性判断的核心技术。与词汇匹配不同，语义匹配能够理解同义表达、隐含关系和抽象概念之间的语义关联。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 语义匹配范式&#10;        LEXICAL[词汇匹配]&#10;        SHALLOW[浅层语义匹配]&#10;        DEEP[深度语义匹配]&#10;    end&#10;    LEXICAL --&gt; TF[TF-IDF]&#10;    LEXICAL --&gt; BM[BM25]&#10;    SHALLOW --&gt; DSSM_M[DSSM]&#10;    SHALLOW --&gt; CDSSM[C-DSSM]&#10;    DEEP --&gt; BERT_M[BERT 交互匹配]&#10;    DEEP --&gt; COLBERT_M[ColBERT 延迟交互]&#10;    subgraph 演进方向&#10;        TF --&gt; DSSM_M&#10;        DSSM_M --&gt; BERT_M&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 语义匹配范式\n        LEXICAL[词汇匹配]\n        SHALLOW[浅层语义匹配]\n        DEEP[深度语义匹配]\n    end\n    LEXICAL --&gt; TF[TF-IDF]\n    LEXICAL --&gt; BM[BM25]\n    SHALLOW --&gt; DSSM_M[DSSM]\n    SHALLOW --&gt; CDSSM[C-DSSM]\n    DEEP --&gt; BERT_M[BERT 交互匹配]\n    DEEP --&gt; COLBERT_M[ColBERT 延迟交互]\n    subgraph 演进方向\n        TF --&gt; DSSM_M\n        DSSM_M --&gt; BERT_M\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>匹配层次</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>交互方式</th>\n<th>计算复杂度</th>\n<th>匹配质量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>词汇匹配</td>\n<td>BM25/TF-IDF</td>\n<td>无（词频统计）</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表示交互</td>\n<td>DSSM/Bi-Encoder</td>\n<td>独立编码 → 向量相似度</td>\n<td>O(n+m)</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟交互</td>\n<td>ColBERT</td>\n<td>独立编码 → token 级交互</td>\n<td>O(n×m)</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完全交互</td>\n<td>BERT Cross-Encoder</td>\n<td>联合编码</td>\n<td>O((n+m)²)</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"交互式语义匹配模型\">交互式语义匹配模型</h2><p>交互式匹配模型（Interaction-based Models）让查询和文档在编码阶段就进行深层交互，从而捕获更细粒度的语义关系。Cross-Encoder 是最典型的交互式模型，它将查询和文档拼接为一个序列，通过 Transformer 的自注意力机制实现全交互。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CrossEncoderInput {&#10;  queryTokens: string[];&#10;  docTokens: string[];&#10;  separator: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface MatchingScore {&#10;  score: number;&#10;  attentionWeights?: Float32Array[][];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function buildCrossEncoderInput(query: string, document: string): string {&#10;  return `[CLS] ${query} [SEP] ${document} [SEP]`;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CrossEncoderConfig {&#10;  model: string;&#10;  maxLength: number;&#10;  batchSize: number;&#10;  useHalfPrecision: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function crossEncoderScore(pairs: Array&lt;[string, string]&gt;, config: CrossEncoderConfig): Promise&lt;number[]&gt; {&#10;  const inputs = pairs.map(([q, d]) =&gt; buildCrossEncoderInput(q, d));&#10;  const batches = chunk(inputs, config.batchSize);&#10;  const allScores: number[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (const batch of batches) {&#10;    const encodings = tokenize(batch, config.maxLength);&#10;    const logits = await forwardPass(encodings, config.model);&#10;    const scores = logits.map((l) =&gt; sigmoid(l[0]));&#10;    allScores.push(...scores);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return allScores;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function sigmoid(x: number): number {&#10;  return 1 / (1 + Math.exp(-x));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrossEncoderInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queryTokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  docTokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  separator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MatchingScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  attentionWeights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildCrossEncoderInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=