t</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> docId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cell.docIds) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        candidateDocs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(docId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> scored</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">candidateDocs].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">docId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    docId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">maxSimScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(queryEmbeddings, index.docEmbeddings.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(docId)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scored.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.score).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, topK);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ColBERT v2 通过残差压缩（Residual Compression）将每个 token 嵌入压缩为 2 字节的残差编码，大幅减少了索引大小。PLAID 引擎进一步优化了检索效率，使 ColBERT 在十亿级文档上的延迟降至 100ms 以内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识蒸馏与模型压缩\">知识蒸馏与模型压缩</h2><p>语义匹配模型的部署面临延迟和成本的挑战。知识蒸馏（Knowledge Distillation）通过让小模型（学生）模仿大模型（教师）的输出来压缩模型，在保持匹配质量的同时大幅降低计算开销。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>蒸馏方法</th>\n<th>教师模型</th>\n<th>学生模型</th>\n<th>蒸馏信号</th>\n<th>效果保持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分数蒸馏</td>\n<td>Cross-Encoder</td>\n<td>Bi-Encoder</td>\n<td>相关性分数</td>\n<td>85-95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序蒸馏</td>\n<td>Cross-Encoder</td>\n<td>Bi-Encoder</td>\n<td>文档排序</td>\n<td>90-95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表示蒸馏</td>\n<td>大 Bi-Encoder</td>\n<td>小 Bi-Encoder</td>\n<td>向量表示</td>\n<td>80-90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多教师蒸馏</td>\n<td>多个 Cross-Encoder</td>\n<td>Bi-Encoder</td>\n<td>加权平均分数</td>\n<td>92-97%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自蒸馏</td>\n<td>同模型大版本</td>\n<td>同模型小版本</td>\n<td>软标签</td>\n<td>88-93%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DistillationConfig {&#10;  teacherModel: CrossEncoder;&#10;  studentModel: BiEncoder;&#10;  temperature: number;&#10;  alpha: number;&#10;  hardLabelWeight: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function distillationLoss(&#10;  studentScores: number[],&#10;  teacherScores: number[],&#10;  hardLabels: number[],&#10;  config: DistillationConfig,&#10;): number {&#10;  const { temperature, alpha, hardLabelWeight } = config;&#10;&#10;  const softTeacher = softmax(teacherScores.map((s) =&gt; s / temperature));&#10;  const softStudent = softmax(studentScores.map((s) =&gt; s / temperature));&#10;  const klLoss = klDivergence(softTeacher, softStudent) * temperature * temperature;&#10;&#10;  const hardLoss = crossEntropyLoss(studentScores, hardLabels);&#10;&#10;  return alpha * klLoss + hardLabelWeight * hardLoss;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DistillationConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  teacherModel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrossEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  studentModel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BiEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hardLabelWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> distillationLoss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  studentScores</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  teacherScores</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hardLabels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DistillationConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">temperature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hardLabelWeight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> softTeacher</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> softmax</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(teacherScores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> softStudent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> softmax</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(studentScores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> klLoss</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> klDivergence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(softTeacher, softStudent) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> hardLoss</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> crossEntropyLoss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(studentScores, hardLabels);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> klLoss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hardLabelWeight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hardLoss;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>除了知识蒸馏，模型量化（INT8/INT4）、剪枝（Layer Dropping、Attention Head Pruning）和结构优化（TinyBERT、MiniLM）也是常用的压缩方法。在实际部署中，通常组合使用多种压缩技术以达到最优的效率-质量平衡。蒸馏后的 Bi-Encoder 学生模型即可接入<a href=\"../neural-retrieval/dense-retrieval\">稠密检索</a>的双塔管线，承担大规模在线召回。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>语义匹配从词汇匹配演进到深度交互匹配，表示能力逐步增强，但计算复杂度也相应增加</li>\n<li>Cross-Encoder 的匹配质量最高但计算最重，适合作为重排序模型处理小规模候选集</li>\n<li>ColBERT 的延迟交互架构在质量和效率之间取得了创新性的平衡，支持十亿级文档检索</li>\n<li>知识蒸馏（Cross-Encoder → Bi-Encoder）是将高质量匹配能力迁移到高效检索模型的核心方法</li>\n<li>实际系统通常采用级联架构：稀疏检索 → 稠密检索 → 精排 Cross-Encoder，各层模型复杂度递增</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语义匹配","id":"语义匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"交互式语义匹配模型","id":"交互式语义匹配模型"},{"level":2,"text":"ColBERT 延迟交互","id":"colbert-延迟交互"},{"level":2,"text":"知识蒸馏与模型压缩","id":"知识蒸馏与模型压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"查询改写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/query-understanding/query-rewriting"},"next":{"title":"学习排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models/learning-to-rank"}}